Homepage: https://github.com/m4dm4x1337/initramfs-wifi
Description: Initramfs Wi-Fi support
 This package provides Wi-Fi support for the initramfs in the early stages of
 the boot process. It includes necessary dependencies such as wpa_supplicant, 
 wireless kernel modules, and associated firmware files into the initrd so 
 that the kernel can initialize Wi-Fi hardware in the early phase of the boot
 process. The Wi-Fi support integrates seamlessly with Dropbear and other
 network-capable initramfs tools.
